Dhrystone Benchmark, Version 2.1 (C version)

Author:  Reinhold P. Weicker, Siemens AG, Erlangen, Germany
Date:    May 25, 1988

The original Dhrystone source code was distributed via Usenet
(comp.arch) without any copyright notice or license restriction.
It is widely considered to be in the public domain.

The files dhry.h, dhry_1.c, and dhry_2.c in this directory are
unmodified from the original 1988 distribution, obtained from:
  https://github.com/Keith-S-Thompson/dhrystone (v2.1/)

The remaining files (entry.c, shim.c, include/) are Penumbra
bare-metal adaptations and follow the project's main license.
